The pattern followed here is,

A + 3 = D; D + 3 = G; G + 3 = J;

B + 4 = F; F + 4 = J; J + 4 = N;

According to alphabetical positions of the letters,

1) (A + B)² + 1 = (1 + 2)² + 1 = 10;

2) (D + F)² + 1 = (4 + 6)² + 1 = 101;

3) (G + J)² + 1 = (7 + 10)² + 1 = 290;

4) (J + N)² + 1 = (10 + 14)² + 1 = 577

Hence, correct answer is JN577.

